{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"前半段（S01-S06）有时把矛盾落在怕自己太黏、给对方造成负担或破坏相处自在上，略偏向表达喜欢时的顾虑。\",\n    \"后半段多次把留不住亲密具体化为对方将来不再需要自己，略微收窄了痛楚的范围。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"比X更明显地把主线转向对方是否需要自己的陪伴、将来是否还会想到自己，容易把留不住亲密的痛楚窄化为失去被需要的位置。\",\n    \"S06主要写害怕被嫌弃后的孤单，S11-S12又转向即使对方未必同样在乎也愿意单方面陪伴和付出，使关系中的相互亲密及其幸福感有所弱化。\",\n    \"多处把表达喜欢写成争取让眼下的好维持更久，或把对方继续需要自己当作安心依据，因而部分偏向关系安全感与被需要感，而非幸福与无法留住幸福本身的纠缠。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X更持续地让亲密带来的真实幸福与对它终将变化、无法保证长久的痛楚同时发生，尤其S04、S06、S07、S09、S11-S13，两者会相互推动而不是轮流出现。Y也包含这两面，但更容易把核心收束为害怕不再被需要、希望继续成为对方愿意依靠的陪伴者。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5d59b5a0-743d-4a25-ac20-8fd68b7bac77", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T074508318342Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:46:18.076923+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "984c516cba5b41abcecf45c89454001353b4835f0faf437db5ebbcd67abc4003", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\cha